Note on scope: this license covers the source code, notebooks, and derived
result tables and metadata (CSV/JSON files) contained in this repository. It
does NOT cover:

- The original photographs and annotations from the DentalAI dataset
  (Valluri, 2023, Kaggle) and the Dental Caries dataset (Roboflow Universe,
  version 1). Both are distributed under CC BY 4.0 and remain subject to their
  original licenses and attribution requirements. See Sections 3 and 8 of
  README.md for details and links to the original sources.
- The SAM 2 model and its base weights (Ravi et al., 2024), which remain
  subject to their own license in the official repository
  (facebookresearch/sam2). Fine-tuned checkpoints derived from SAM 2 must
  also comply with that license.
